{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24415","headline":"寒食日寄杨东川 · 白居易","name":"寒食日寄杨东川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知杨六逢寒食，作底欢娱过此辰。\n兜率寺高宜望月，嘉陵江近好游春。\n蛮旗似火行随马，蜀妓如花坐遶身。\n不使黔娄夫妇看，夸张富贵向何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}